WEBVTT

00:11:57.447 --> 00:12:00.351
You've got to shrink it down
and be about one issue."

00:12:00.375 --> 00:12:02.535
And really, they fundamentally told you,

00:12:03.319 --> 00:12:04.845
"Are you going to hug a tree?

00:12:05.453 --> 00:12:07.580
Or are you going to hug a child? Pick.

00:12:07.604 --> 00:12:09.216
Are you going to hug a tree?

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.309
Or are you going to hug a child? Pick."

00:12:11.333 --> 00:12:13.785
Well, when you start working
on issues like plastic,

00:12:13.809 --> 00:12:16.008
you realize the whole thing is connected.

00:12:16.032 --> 00:12:18.812
And luckily, most of us are blessed
to have two arms --

00:12:18.836 --> 00:12:20.227
we can hug both.

00:12:20.251 --> 00:12:21.620
Thank you very much.

00:12:21.644 --> 00:12:28.555
(Applause)